{
    "title": "Moodpress - Mood Diary Tracker",
    "description": "Personal diary of your feelings and activities.\r\n\r\nJoin your Moodpress to not only record your mood but also save your secrets, important photos and any life records no matter when and where. It's also a really awesome humor mission to analyze your recorded emotional diary.\r\n\r\n[main function]\r\n\r\n1. Protect your privacy and keep it confidential \ud83d\udd0f\r\n - Fingerprint recognition and password function support.\r\n2. Set and organize your personal diary \ud83d\udcdd\r\n - Dates, moods, photos, video, activity tags, dynamic themes, etc.\r\n3. Create an activity with your own phrase \ud83c\udff7\r\n - Search and add custom activities used with selected icon.\r\n4. Mood management function through calendar and charts \ud83d\udcca\r\n5. Healing sound help you calm down \ud83c\udfb6\r\n - Be genuinely aware of your inner feelings.\r\n6. Diary Backup & Restore \u2601\ufe0f\r\n - Backup/Restore secrets to your private Google/Dropbox account.\r\n7. Set the diary alarm and receive it at the desired time \u23f0\r\n8. You can export PDF documents \ud83d\udcc2\r\n9. Quickly share your monthly mood calendar with the theme and emoticons you want \ud83d\uddd3\r\n10. View and use directly on the screen through convenient widgets \u2764\ufe0f\r\n\r\n\u2705  The Moodpress app integrates with Health Connect, allowing users to import Sleep, Step and Heart Rate Variability (HRV) data into charts in Moodpress, making your daily health, stress status and mood statistics clearly visible.\r\n\r\n\u231a\ufe0f Wear OS App Features:\r\n- Track steps and sleep time, and compare results to the previous day.\r\n- Use the Moodpress Wear OS app on your smartwatch to learn about your current stress levels based on your HR (Heart Rate) and HRV (Heart Rate Variability) data. Additionally, with your permission, you can receive timely notifications to keep an eye on your stress levels.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f The diary is always saved on your phone. Moodpress values your privacy and does not store or collect it separately.\r\n\r\nFollow us for more updates \ud83d\ude4c\r\nInstagram: @moodpressapp\r\nTwitter: @MoodpressApp\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.yoobool.com/moodpress/terms\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.yoobool.com/moodpress/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Personal diary of your feelings and activities.<br><br>Join your Moodpress to not only record your mood but also save your secrets, important photos and any life records no matter when and where. It&#39;s also a really awesome humor mission to analyze your recorded emotional diary.<br><br>[main function]<br><br>1. Protect your privacy and keep it confidential \ud83d\udd0f<br> - Fingerprint recognition and password function support.<br>2. Set and organize your personal diary \ud83d\udcdd<br> - Dates, moods, photos, video, activity tags, dynamic themes, etc.<br>3. Create an activity with your own phrase \ud83c\udff7<br> - Search and add custom activities used with selected icon.<br>4. Mood management function through calendar and charts \ud83d\udcca<br>5. Healing sound help you calm down \ud83c\udfb6<br> - Be genuinely aware of your inner feelings.<br>6. Diary Backup &amp; Restore \u2601\ufe0f<br> - Backup/Restore secrets to your private Google/Dropbox account.<br>7. Set the diary alarm and receive it at the desired time \u23f0<br>8. You can export PDF documents \ud83d\udcc2<br>9. Quickly share your monthly mood calendar with the theme and emoticons you want \ud83d\uddd3<br>10. View and use directly on the screen through convenient widgets \u2764\ufe0f<br><br>\u2705  The Moodpress app integrates with Health Connect, allowing users to import Sleep, Step and Heart Rate Variability (HRV) data into charts in Moodpress, making your daily health, stress status and mood statistics clearly visible.<br><br>\u231a\ufe0f Wear OS App Features:<br>- Track steps and sleep time, and compare results to the previous day.<br>- Use the Moodpress Wear OS app on your smartwatch to learn about your current stress levels based on your HR (Heart Rate) and HRV (Heart Rate Variability) data. Additionally, with your permission, you can receive timely notifications to keep an eye on your stress levels.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f The diary is always saved on your phone. Moodpress values your privacy and does not store or collect it separately.<br><br>Follow us for more updates \ud83d\ude4c<br>Instagram: @moodpressapp<br>Twitter: @MoodpressApp<br><br>Terms of Use: https://www.yoobool.com/moodpress/terms<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.yoobool.com/moodpress/privacy",
